    "directions": [
      "In a pan, add red millet flour and dry roast it.",
      "In a bowl add curd, water, salt and whisk well.",
      "In another pan add oil, chopped green chillies and fry them. Remove few fried green chillies and keep aside.",
      "Now add chopped ginger, spring onion, carrot, nachni flour, curd mixture, water, salt in a same pan, mix well and let it cook. Add french beans.",
      "For the lassi, in a blender, add popcorn, curd, sugar, water and blend.",
      "Garnish the dish with raw mango, fried green chillies, sesame seeds, roasted cumin powder and popcorn.",
      "Serve the dish with popcorn lassi."
    ],
